{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "de6bde0216d109504cf1d337841c6d66313d7adafede38eeee5a69547813eb70", "ja": "アイドルズ、いん・だ・はうす！", "zh": "偶像们，in the house！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b3caa27419a289e7d0e106a2d28d45602af4dc6262a3347903e5789f3058ee0e", "ja": "サプライズライブまであと数日。メンバー達\nは現地の高校を再訪し、卒業生にバレないよ\nうにこっそりリハを終える。ライブで流す映\n像も無事完成、在校生たちと一緒に、当日に\n向けて結束を強めていく。", "zh": "距离惊喜演唱会还有几天。成员们再次造访当地高中，为了不被毕业生发现，悄悄完成了彩排。演唱会上要播放的影像也顺利完成，成员们与在校生一起，为演出当天进一步凝聚了力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "34f3faa399319ccec927557352e3473181a67d2219aa073a1f3647740a9ad02e", "ja": "（サプライズライブまで残り数日。ライブのリハで、\n高校にやってきている。授業は休みの日だけど……）", "zh": "（距离惊喜演唱会只剩几天了。为了彩排，我们来到了高中，\n虽然今天是不上课的休息日，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "7c01d9418c70dbb462c0934d45e2c6f1ecc1f4e64148b4454acf16eb99a3f1c8", "ja": "くふふ♪　おやすみの日の学校って、\nなんだかすっごくワクワクするね！　不思議！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪ 放假日的学校，总觉得特别让人兴奋呢！真奇怪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "441f3081d91ba1139125724a1ca3447eca9d61dba42ef63c1980a1aa4c23fe97", "ja": "いつもはたくさん人がいるはずなのに、今は静かで。\nクラブ活動の声が、遠くから聞こえてきて……。", "zh": "平时明明应该有很多人的，可现在却很安静。还能听到远处传来的社团活动声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "84a55269a1a0d34bda659c93865d39717d7d86f4097b4d89ac6f0fe66c4de6a3", "ja": "うんうん、ちょっとだけ不気味な感じもするけど、\n非日常感があっていいよね！", "zh": "嗯嗯，虽然感觉也有点阴森森的，\n但很有非日常的感觉，挺不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1004_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "c4ea2bfc79ddd3a15d20ca38e70b81f3b14d208d622ed5ad4b8d7a4edc33e709", "ja": "みなさん、お疲れさまです！\n今日のリハ、よろしくお願いしますね。", "zh": "各位辛苦了！\n今天的彩排，就拜托大家了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "86455dbb15137ebfb13f433e19099e9d6650c2f0126cfaaa2052eff041725e8b", "ja": "っと……お疲れさまです。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "那个……辛苦了。\n我这边才要请您多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "4d30224ebcfbb08aeea4fae59f64aa9a411a518d2073f020536e1d11aec9e8f9", "ja": "お願いしまーすっ！", "zh": "拜托啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "4d30224ebcfbb08aeea4fae59f64aa9a411a518d2073f020536e1d11aec9e8f9", "ja": "お願いしまーすっ！", "zh": "拜托啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "4d30224ebcfbb08aeea4fae59f64aa9a411a518d2073f020536e1d11aec9e8f9", "ja": "お願いしまーすっ！", "zh": "拜托啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1009_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "4de10930159401efb6f0224693d54673773d037753e084a656e8ff28ddb54895", "ja": "リハーサルの映像も番組に使うので、\nカメラを回させてください。あ、あと……。", "zh": "因为排练的影像也会用于节目，所以请让我开机拍摄。啊，对了，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1010_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "45eadcf6740fdecdacc2d1c8016dee5384b2cf24816b2d222cf2b817edf1b0ba", "ja": "今日、運動部の子とかは登校してるんで、\nなるべく見つからないようにお願いしますね！", "zh": "今天运动部的孩子们也在上学，请尽量不要被发现哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "52efcd231212927bb2227e7efb873e9c6cb6a137e43cee955c27a870fac4e35b", "ja": "茜ちゃん達がアイドルってバレたら、\nサプライズにならないもんね。オッケーでーす！", "zh": "要是被发现小茜们是偶像，就不能算惊喜了嘛。好的——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "023e2535e99b4c0c26afc155ff641ee603a4e8eee176d65e7b03aae89456c837", "ja": "移動とか、見つからないようにすればいいんだよね？\nたまき、かくれんぼ得意だから平気だぞ～！", "zh": "只要移动时不被发现就行了吧？环很擅长捉迷藏，所以没问题哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "9d87c5f8d267432ca1323483c927c1a1b5b2a6a1f1bceb21bd3d08ce2efda32c", "ja": "ふふっ……あっ！？\n廊下に、生徒のみなさんが……！", "zh": "呵呵……啊！？\n走廊上有好多学生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1014_null", "source_sha256": "476c0035eeb801024a0779df701b5773782d97df2a0e8ebe70e87af9526f4e3d", "ja": "ワイワイ、ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "热闹喧哗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1015_bangumidirector", "source_sha256": "e794c98e8d0f0d2908a01a0ed25e1d194bf6565abcbab3c28a1ff1195939dbaf", "ja": "ま、まずい……三年生です！　隠れてください！", "zh": "糟、糟糕……是三年级生！快躲起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "c8aaa4776aab8ff78119aa02e073eaeb59f89ff9edaa62151b665c49d0680096", "ja": "えっ！？　ええと、ええと……\nみんな、こっちだぞ！", "zh": "诶！？那个，那个……\n大家，到这边来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c61b855626b55ec0ab05d9ddbef25678632dcc037ca00e430e481a3d0f187346", "ja": "（うーん……咄嗟に隠れたのはいいけど、\n生徒たちが立ち話を始めてしまった……動けないぞ）", "zh": "（嗯……虽然突然躲起来是躲好了，\n但学生们却开始站在那里聊天了……没法动了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "c436d1768832bb2fd0fb129ff5d9f9e7d960c81db3c5adaafd4f4dd9a3314619", "ja": "くっ……{$P$}ちゃん。\n茜ちゃんが隙を作るから、その隙にみんなで出よう！", "zh": "啧……{$P$}。等小茜制造出空当，我们就趁机一起出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cd519d825d0ecc0fdba3d0c121d39cd23aff51b3d3c13e6addefe6f22c99242b", "ja": "隙を作るって……どうやって？", "zh": "要制造破绽……怎么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "dc363f1b597a3b1886b6b6fa228fb2d92be0129b2b7e40ad277ad7589bc40fd6", "ja": "ふっふっふ……秘技っ、\n茜ちゃん、オトリ人形の術！　とうっ……！", "zh": "呵呵呵……秘技——\n小茜，诱饵人偶之术！喝——……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1021_null", "source_sha256": "579fa8fc5da31b02d6ea4aab85c130d940e956c82fbd8c634106214db17a29ca", "ja": "ヒュンッ……ポテッ！", "zh": "嗖……啪嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1022_students", "source_sha256": "9758deba5749e47546d6e689843c8dd3080bae4359b7c5d9ee5075cb69db13a7", "ja": "えっ、なにあれ……人形？　どこから……？", "zh": "诶，那是什么……人偶？从哪里来的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "f7f4b2b344fbf12156d9e71c90dfe4c162139951cd93869d9cff2b0f39ed7964", "ja": "みなさん、よそ見してます！\n今のうちに、リハーサルのステージまで……！", "zh": "大家都在看别的地方呢！\n趁现在，快到彩排舞台那边去……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "277c8d2ad8c82a21986845ee3f258cef5a9780f01b7074ae67acd0519feff0fc", "ja": "サプライズって、大変だぞ～……！", "zh": "惊喜可真难准备啊～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "fc6793c43185c0a0cbe6435651477b1f95df46023b4b98b45ed99019cb639359", "ja": "（ふう……どうにか、リハーサルが終わった。\n急遽用意した映像も、素晴らしい出来だった！）", "zh": "（呼……总算把彩排结束了。\n临时准备的影像也做得非常棒！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "0bf82429979b49aab5fd36dcf745c60565e77f55305242945954a442cf977c39", "ja": "おやぶーん！　お疲れさま！\n手ごたえあったぞ～！　いいステージになりそうだね♪", "zh": "老大！辛苦啦！\n感觉很不错哦～！看来会是一场精彩的演出呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1028_seito", "source_sha256": "565dbb8b23898aa922db653850894aa7c8728f87c9314b85a83a0fb017d121ec", "ja": "みなさん、お疲れさまでした！\nリハーサル、見せてもらいました……！", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n我看了排练……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "eb1b6da475ed73ea5d2fe7d53b8c0049e41f83b7bbf2d1e583a4c9a01f0f7f19", "ja": "やあやあ！　依頼人ちゃん、ご満足いただけたかニャ？\nまあ、その顔を見ればわかるけどネ♪　ニャハ☆", "zh": "嗨呀嗨呀！委托人小妹，还满意吗喵？\n哎呀，不过看你的表情就知道啦♪喵哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1030_seito", "source_sha256": "da61fe9955f4540c1ac90ad638833dd4e2e1179c1ab2610081b94faf9aebf091", "ja": "最高……本当に最高でした！\nみなさんのステージも、それに、あの映像も。", "zh": "太棒了……真的太棒了！\n大家的舞台，还有那段影像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1031_seito", "source_sha256": "0871dc08d504d96a2aa9140b62c5d0a9e793387a80f389b44693dd69234adc44", "ja": "思い出がぎゅっと詰まってて、私から見てても、\n涙腺やばくて……先輩たちも泣いちゃいますよ～！", "zh": "里面装满了回忆，就连我看了，\n泪腺都快崩溃了……前辈们也一定会哭出来的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1032_022ser", "source_sha256": "9b78858ee1091fc2630b34bd6180dd64567a5611987674d3e6662566b0f8a558", "ja": "ふふっ♪　きっとそれは、\nみなさんが選んでくれた映像だからだと思います！", "zh": "呵呵♪ 我想一定是因为，那是大家一起挑选出来的视频吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1033_023aka", "source_sha256": "53e777d7708ed6628c3398cb1867262fd6da08bb43ad1b667d871ed3b36f8e8d", "ja": "うんうん、編集はTV局のプロだけど、\n思い出はみんなのものだしね。", "zh": "嗯嗯，虽然剪辑是电视台专业人士负责的，但这些回忆也是大家共同拥有的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1034_seito", "source_sha256": "2b607c04723ef0a86e4ab95a22a28394313a1268b743a5331681ac3c3979a3fa", "ja": "そうですよね……嬉しいです！　私たちも一緒に、\nステージを作っているような気持ちになれて……！", "zh": "是啊……我很开心！我们也有种在一起打造舞台的感觉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1035_022ser", "source_sha256": "bb8640147512ce444d3b7a5386e649aa44e6eced9136f093fceda99ac0e36e9d", "ja": "一緒ですよ！　思い出に残る卒業式に\nしたいっていう気持ちは、わたし達も同じですから。", "zh": "是一样的哦！我们也有着想要一起打造一场令人难忘的毕业典礼的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1036_040tam", "source_sha256": "fb2eb055c83609b6a29fde51820efb8a0034e4f403d0978bc7a4172e1a5f75a5", "ja": "喜んでもらえてよかった～♪\n本番まで、一緒にがんばろうね！　お姉ちゃん。", "zh": "太好了，你能高兴环就很开心～♪\n到正式演出之前，一起加油吧！大姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "cad3f9fb5ecb452604faa204c6f7cb85e0686c8add5c14ed26260673b409cd24", "ja": "そうそう、もう同じチームみたいなものだから。\n本番も、全力で盛り上げてネ！", "zh": "对对，我们已经算是同一个队伍了。\n正式演出时，也要全力把气氛炒热哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1038_seito", "source_sha256": "3dc485e857c2d274c9cdaf6e82c9425f4d9852e187374b85137d0333e79b9520", "ja": "みなさん……ぐすっ。\nわかりました！　全力で盛り上げちゃいますね！", "zh": "大家……呜呜。\n明白了！我会全力炒热气氛的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1039_040tam", "source_sha256": "ebb301947a966e31fc86acbb04175265bc74a8bacaba657a78bdffb738273c52", "ja": "くふふ♪　あんなふうに言ってもらえると、\nうれしいね！　やりがいがあるぞ～！", "zh": "咕呼呼♪ 能被大家那样说，\n真开心！也更有干劲了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1040_022ser", "source_sha256": "3659208d17373f19680b4f9c3f5b95c4b61b4e3a2a233dda27635784dc6c2b80", "ja": "そうですね！　リハーサルも済みましたし……\n後は本番を、大成功させるだけですね♪", "zh": "是呀！彩排也结束了……\n接下来只要让正式演出大获成功就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0273_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0273_story_05_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "c431205c4aaa5f12e2b0c6b3428de4629297788925ea14ef252cd6627936cbaa", "ja": "よーし、それじゃふたりとも！\n笑顔いっぱいの卒業式に向けて、本番もがんばろうね！", "zh": "好～的，那么两位！\n为了办一场充满笑容的毕业典礼，正式演出也要加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
